  "details": "Some things on quest pause on the middle of the world loading screen  or when in your menu and refuse to load your content within a certain time delay when first opening the menu as of 8-12-20 after the update. I will at times be forced to exit a menu I was needing before I can see it load properly into view. The worlds too have the same issue when loading with a lag timeout on real-time instances. Also I will get randomly booted from a loading instance when it seems just fine and told the system run out of memory when that in fact isn't the case because I have over 70% of my device storage and ram empty from use-age. Please fix this.",
